        <ResourceDictionary Source="/CluadeX;component/Resources/Themes/ModernScrollBars.xaml"/>
    </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>

    <!--
        ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        THEME: Neon Cyber LED — near-black HUD, LED-strip borders, cyan / magenta / lime glow, a faint grid.
        Owner-approved design: E:\cluadex-bld\research\themes\NeonMain.dc.html
        (picker preview: ThemePicker.dc.html — #070812 grid, #00E5FF strips, #FF2BD6 / #A6FF00 glow).

        Colour roles (keep them when adding a token):
          • CYAN    #00E5FF  structure — LED strips, focus, links, inputs, borders, the grid
          • MAGENTA #FF2BD6  action + "you are here" — primary buttons, selection, the active rail item
          • LIME    #A6FF00  success, LEDs that are on, checkboxes
          • AMBER   #FFB000  warning, cost, the execution line         · RED #FF5C7A danger
          • VIOLET  #B45CFF  third accent (legacy "magenta" role)      · BLUE #3DA5FF info
          Text ladder on #070812: E6F1FF › D5DEFA › B9C4E8 › 9AA6D0 › 8692C2 (≥ 5.9:1) › 7682B2 (≥ 4.8:1 on every surface) —
          every step that can carry body text stays ≥ 4.5:1.

        Rules (tests/themetest enforces the first two):
          • Keep EXACTLY the keys Midnight.xaml has — no key only one theme defines, same kind of value.
          • Theme.Id stays "NeonCyber".
          • Glows are this theme's identity — keep them as DropShadowEffect tokens (ShadowDepth 0), never inline.
          • Bg.* stay SOLID brushes: C# reads them with ThemeService.ColorOf, which cannot read a tiled brush.
            The grid lives in Backdrop.Nebula only (one full-window rectangle in MainWindow).
          • Style overrides cannot live here: Theme.xaml is merged AFTER the theme slot, so a style with the
            same key in this file would be shadowed (and a new key would break the parity check). Corner
            radii and border thicknesses therefore stay those of the shared styles.
        ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    -->

    <sys:String x:Key="Theme.Id">NeonCyber</sys:String>

